------------
UPDATE INFO
------------
I recently went through and updated all of my themes to make them Win9x/2k/NT compatible.  This includes cleaning up some code, adding gradient colors, updating graphics, improving cursors where necessary, etc.  I hope you enjoy the changes!
; source: https://archive.org/details/batmanta


